cowproof
=========

This software includes components from the following project:

anthropics/sandbox-runtime
  - Source: https://github.com/anthropics/sandbox-runtime
  - Commit: 344e5ea (as of 2026-10-09)
  - License: Apache-2.0
  - Attribution: cowproof's sandbox policy design (SandboxPolicy type in crates/cowproof-run/src/lib.rs)
